.page basename 1 strip the directory and a suffix from a path

# SYNOPSIS
*basename* _PATH_ [_SUFFIX_]

# DESCRIPTION
`basename` prints the last component of _PATH_. If _SUFFIX_ is given and the name ends with it (and is longer), the suffix is removed too.

# EXAMPLES
    basename /ScarletDevilMansion/share/patchouli/1/ls.pw
    basename /bin/ls.pw .pw

# SEE ALSO
dirname(1), realpath(1)
